Scope. This licence covers the code of SpearShift (scripts/, tests/, configs/, prompts/, notebooks/,
docs/, the Makefile and the committed reports/ and results/ tables). It does not cover the datasets:
the derived variant dataset and the paraphrase cache (data/, not in this repository) are released under
